<title>SPAIN: Spain's August unemployment at 21.80 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's August unemployment at 21.80 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute (INE) gave the following monthly figures:</p>
<p> UNEMPLOYMENT			SEP '96</p>
<p> Total unemployed (million)	    3.496</p>
<p> Pct of workforce (pct)	   21.80</p>
<p>The statement added that September unemployment data fall 0.53 percent from the previous month. September unemployed as total in number declined 0.52 percent.</p>
<p>NOTE - Data based on INE survey of households (EPA). The labour ministry publishes separate unemployment figures based on registered unemployed.</p>
</text>
